  "full_text": "So, there's a Bible passage which says, the Lord has declared a famine, not a famine for bread, but for the Word of God. So right now, Jesus says, don't pray like the person who says, I'm glad I'm not a loser. No, you're supposed to be humble. At the moment, what I think is, I'm glad I'm not a loser. I look at the desolation. The punishment for this generation is no thrills. Your parents have cut off your balls, okay? Your parents, all energy comes from God, okay? All thought comes from God. You little arrogant fool. Now you're going to be locked in hell, in blackness. And you'll have to live in it and die in it. Live and die in blackness.",
